{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17214420","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17214420","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721442001:0":{"text":"이 사기꾼! 돈을 에이미에게 돌려줘요! 전 재산이란 말이에요!","source_cn":"骗子，把钱还给艾米！那是她的全部财产！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC801A8879CF833DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721442002:0":{"text":"그리고 이 마법사 로브도 훔친 거죠? 당장 벗어요!","source_cn":"还有这件魔法师的袍子，也是你偷来的吧？脱下来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC631050D7B1DA87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721442003:0":{"text":"죄송합니다... 잘못했습니다! 돈은 전부 돌려드릴게요!","source_cn":"别打了……我错了，我错了！我把钱全还给你们还不行吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58C53013D9A004F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721442004:0":{"text":"그리고 에이미에게 사기 쳐서 미안하다고 사과하세요!","source_cn":"另外，向艾米道歉，承认你骗了她！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB911C0386C7B4343","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721442005:0":{"text":"...미, 미안해... 나...","source_cn":"……我……对不起，我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11919A0C99A03E34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721442006:0":{"text":"에이미, 사과하지 마! 네 잘못 아닌 거 알아. 전부 이 사기꾼이 잘못한 거야!","source_cn":"艾米，你不需要道歉！我们都知道这不是你的错，要怪就怪这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCC0EACCAE3F0BDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721442007:0":{"text":"아니야... 나도... 계속 나 자신을 속여온 사기꾼인걸...","source_cn":"不、不……我也是骗子……我一直都在骗自己……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x211B7CC4D7AE7DAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721442008:0":{"text":"오리안 왕자님이 거기 계실 리 없다는 거... 알고 있었어...","source_cn":"其实我早就知道……奥利安殿下不可能在……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A3B9CE655D63310","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721442009:0":{"text":"에이미!","source_cn":"艾米！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A4D428CBBF8997A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721442010:0":{"text":"그럼 나는... 이제 뭘 위해서 살아야 하는 거지...","source_cn":"那我……我还有什么……还有什么活下去的理由……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11DAD89128C53ACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721442011:0":{"text":"에이미, 그런 생각 하지 마!","source_cn":"艾米！你千万别这样想！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EDE332DEC5D3781","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721442012:0":{"text":"어머니는 돌아가시고 아버지에게는 버림받았어. 가문도 없고... 이제는 왕자님마저... 내 마지막 희망이 사라졌는데, 난 이제 어떻게 살아야 해?","source_cn":"母亲不在了，父亲抛弃了我……家族也没了……现在连奥利安...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD426A0BF797A095A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721442013:0":{"text":"우... 우리가 있잖아!","source_cn":"你……你还有我们啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29A89AC28AB69A55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1721442014:0":{"text":"아니, 내가 상층 지구를 떠났을 때부터 우리는 이미 다른 세계 사람인 거야. 언젠가는...","source_cn":"不，在我搬出上城区的时候，我们就不是一个世界的人了。迟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB44F5DB25FBFC106","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1721442015:0":{"text":"...에이미...","source_cn":"……艾米……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x962067CC8D5309F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1721442015":{"text":"...에이미...","source_cn":"……艾米……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x962067CC8D5309F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_re